---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SimpleHero from '../components/page/SimpleHero.astro';
import Prose from '../components/page/Prose.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Magnus Path" description="How Magnus Path collects, uses and protects personal information shared through our website, forms and WhatsApp.">
  <SimpleHero eyebrow="Legal" h1="Privacy Policy" intro="Last updated: 16 October 2026. This policy explains what personal information we collect through this website and how we use it." current="Privacy Policy" />
  <Prose>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>{site.legalName} (“Magnus Path”, “we”, “us”) is an e-commerce marketing agency based in {site.address.locality}, {site.address.region}, India. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Details you submit in our forms: name, email, phone/WhatsApp number, store or website link, sales range and the service you need.</li>
      <li>Messages you send us by email, phone or WhatsApp.</li>
      <li>Basic usage data collected by analytics tools, such as pages visited, device type and approximate location.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To prepare your free audit, respond to your enquiry and send proposals.</li>
      <li>To provide services you hire us for.</li>
      <li>To improve our website and measure which pages and campaigns work.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with service providers that help us run our business (for example email, CRM and analytics tools), under confidentiality obligations.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>We use cookies and similar technologies for analytics and advertising measurement (for example Google Analytics and the Meta pixel). You can block cookies in your browser settings.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you can ask us to access, correct or erase your personal data, or withdraw consent. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>
    <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiry data for as long as needed to respond and for our legitimate business records, and we protect it with reasonable security measures.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. The latest version is always on this page.</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
